what about this. a product you login for, and have 100 free gemini flash pairs to compare. you make a tag. you submit drafts of an essay, programming languages, potential directions/ideas. you can control the context preamble part of the prompt (in case you need to sorterpill the model before decidign on directions). it live ranks your takes while you write them down. the ranking stream/poll back to you as you submit more. i think the "ai is the only voter" paradigm makes the ui very easy. all you have to do is submit ideas/drafts to the ai to get good rankings back. its a new paradigm in ai: asking for its preferences.
